{"id": "32de26b7-9d1b-407d-882b-db0d21fb08f7", "slug": "ollio-automate-your-life", "title": "Ollio - Automate your life", "description": "Ollio Automate Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Ollio - Automate your life\"\ndescription: \"Ollio Automate Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#0094FF\"\n  secondary: \"#162032\"\n  accent: \"#009AFF\"\n  background: \"#FFF8DF\"\n  surface: \"#162032\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Ollio - Automate your life\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 29; favorites: 4; remixes: 3.\nTags: feature, section, animated.\n## Overview\nOllio Automate Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nOllio Products About Features Support Book a call Over 200+ Businesses Automate your life with natural language If you want to achieve ground-breaking growth with increased sales and profitability with paid ads, then yo…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Automate your life with natural language.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #0094FF, secondary #162032, accent #009AFF, background #FFF8DF, surface #162032, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n    <title>Auralis - AI Workflow Studio</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <style>\n        body {\n            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n        }\n\n        .mesh-bg {\n            background:\n                radial-gradient(circle at -4% 4%, rgba(0, 148, 255, 0.98) 0%, rgba(0, 154, 255, 0.82) 15%, transparent 34%),\n                radial-gradient(circle at 11% 12%, rgba(0, 45, 150, 0.95) 0%, rgba(0, 83, 200, 0.65) 10%, transparent 25%),\n                radial-gradient(circle at 32% 12%, rgba(159, 230, 255, 0.98) 0%, rgba(196, 241, 255, 0.82) 20%, transparent 39%),\n                radial-gradient(circle at 55% 10%, rgba(255, 239, 40, 1) 0%, rgba(255, 226, 35, 0.95) 27%, transparent 48%),\n                radial-gradient(circle at 78% 12%, rgba(255, 175, 0, 0.98) 0%, rgba(255, 118, 24, 0.82) 24%, transparent 45%),\n                radial-gradient(circle at 104% 8%, rgba(255, 24, 90, 0.95) 0%, rgba(255, 72, 122, 0.78) 26%, transparent 49%),\n                radial-gradient(circle at 90% 47%, rgba(255, 137, 178, 0.7) 0%, rgba(255, 200, 210, 0.75) 29%, transparent 54%),\n                radial-gradient(circle at 47% 46%, rgba(255, 243, 118, 0.88) 0%, rgba(255, 251, 203, 0.78) 23%, transparent 49%),\n                radial-gradient(circle at 32% 75%, rgba(255, 251, 225, 1) 0%, rgba(255, 248, 223, 0.82) 34%, transparent 58%),\n                linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 252, 231, 0) 0%, rgba(255, 250, 237, 0.72) 63%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 1) 100%);\n            filter: blur(18px) saturate(1.18);\n            transform: scale(1.06);\n        }\n\n        .left-blue-beam {\n            background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center,\n                    rgba(0, 32, 128, 0.9) 0%,\n                    rgba(0, 90, 210, 0.58) 36%,\n                    transparent 72%);\n            filter: blur(44px);\n        }\n\n        .soft-noise {\n            background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45) 1px, transparent 1px);\n            background-size: 3px 3px;\n            opacity: 0.08;\n            mix-blend-mode: soft-light;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"relative min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden flex flex-col font-sans text-slate-800 bg-[#fff8df]\">\n\n    <!-- Fluid Mesh Gradient Background -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-[-1] overflow-hidden pointer-events-none bg-[#fff8df]\">\n\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 mesh-bg\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"absolute -left-[7%] -top-[12%] h-[74vh] w-[31vw] rotate-[14deg] opacity-85 left-blue-beam\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"absolute left-[34%] top-[11%] h-[62vh] w-[42vw] opacity-60\" style=\"\n        background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(255, 242, 74, 0.9) 0%, rgba(255, 242, 156, 0.54) 38%, transparent 72%);\n        filter: blur(58px);\n      \">\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"absolute -right-[11%] top-[0%] h-[70vh] w-[46vw] opacity-80\" style=\"\n        background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(255, 39, 100, 0.86) 0%, rgba(255, 125, 81, 0.62) 38%, transparent 72%);\n        filter: blur(64px);\n      \">\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-[42vh]\" style=\"\n        background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0), rgba(255,250,235,0.78) 55%, rgba(255,255,255,1) 100%);\n      \">\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 backdrop-blur-[18px] bg-white/[0.03]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 soft-noise\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Header -->\n    <header class=\"w-full relative z-20 flex justify-between items-center py-6 px-6 md:px-12 max-w-[90rem] mx-auto\">\n\n        <!-- Brand -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-white drop-shadow-sm\">\n            <div class=\"relative h-8 w-8\">\n                <span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-3.5 w-3.5 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full border-[3px] border-white/85\"></span>\n                <span class=\"absolute right-0 top-1/2 h-3.5 w-3.5 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full border-[3px] border-white/85\"></span>\n                <span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-3.5 w-3.5 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full border-[3px] border-white/85\"></span>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight\">Auralis</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-10 text-sm font-medium text-[#162032]\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\">Platform</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\">Solutions</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\">Resources</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\">Pricing</a>\n        </nav>\n\n        <a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"bg-white text-[#162032] px-6 py-3 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium shadow-sm hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors\">\n            Start free\n        </a>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Main Content -->\n    <main class=\"flex-grow flex flex-col items-center justify-center relative z-10 px-4 pt-16 pb-16 md:pt-24 lg:pt-28\">\n\n        <div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto w-full flex flex-col items-center text-center\">\n\n            <!-- Trust Indicators -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-10\">\n                <div class=\"flex -space-x-3\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/100?img=11\" alt=\"User 1\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-[3px] border-white/65 shadow-sm object-cover\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/100?img=12\" alt=\"User 2\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-[3px] border-white/65 shadow-sm object-cover\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/100?img=13\" alt=\"User 3\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-[3px] border-white/65 shadow-sm object-cover\">\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col items-start gap-0.5\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center text-[#162032] text-sm\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-bold\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-bold\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-bold\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-bold\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-bold\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[#162032]\">Loved by 500+ creative teams</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Headline -->\n            <h1\n                class=\"text-[3.6rem] md:text-[5.8rem] lg:text-[6.35rem] font-medium tracking-[-0.065em] text-[#162032] leading-[0.92] max-w-5xl\">\n                Create smarter workflows\n                <br />\n                <span class=\"font-serif italic font-normal tracking-[-0.04em]\">with AI-powered</span>\n                clarity\n            </h1>\n\n            <!-- Subheadline -->\n            <p class=\"mt-9 text-base md:text-lg text-[#162032] max-w-2xl font-normal leading-relaxed\">\n                Auralis helps teams turn messy tasks, scattered tools, and repeated requests into simple automated\n                systems that feel easy to manage.\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- CTA Buttons -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-5 mt-10\">\n                <a href=\"#\"\n                    class=\"w-full sm:w-auto bg-[#08294A] text-white px-12 py-4 rounded-xl font-medium text-base hover:bg-[#102f50] transition-colors shadow-lg shadow-slate-900/10\">\n                    Start free\n                </a>\n\n                <a href=\"#\"\n                    class=\"w-full sm:w-auto bg-white/38 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/35 text-[#162032] px-9 py-4 rounded-xl font-medium text-base flex items-center justify-center gap-2 hover:bg-white/55 transition-colors shadow-sm\">\n                    View demo\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Logos Section -->\n        <div class=\"w-full mt-24 md:mt-32 max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center\">\n            <p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate-500 mb-9 tracking-wide\">Trusted by modern product teams</p>\n\n            <div\n                class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-8 md:gap-16 opacity-70 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500\">\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xl font-bold text-slate-800 tracking-tight\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:box-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    Northline\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-lg font-medium text-slate-800\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:globus-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    Flowbase\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-center text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800 tracking-tight\">\n                    BrightDesk\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 tracking-tight\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:routing-2-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    SignalLoop\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-lg font-medium text-slate-800\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:letter-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    Cloudnest\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"hidden lg:flex items-center text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800 tracking-tight\">\n                    Vectra\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </main>\n\n</body>\n\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "ollio-automate-your-life.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/ollio-automate-your-life.jpg", "source_name": "ollio-automate-your-life-DESIGN.md", "views": 83, "forks": 7, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-06-12T07:38:10.793894+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T23:51:25.541465+00:00"}